# Built skill upload bundles.
#
# `.claude/skills/<name>/` is the source of truth; the zip is a build artifact
# regenerated on every version bump and uploaded to Claude settings by hand.
# See the header of each skill's CHANGELOG.md, which states the same split.
#
# Rebuild with, from `.claude/skills/`:
#   zip -rq ../../<name>-v<version>.zip <name>
aeo-seo-geo-expert-v*.zip
